The provider broker, UDS protocol, nft activation policy, and SSH grant helper
use only the Python standard library and host systemd/iproute2/nftables/sudo
surfaces; this change adds no Python or JavaScript dependency. Provider network
authority remains the pinned Vast CLI's exact console.vast.ai TLS origin.
